        "about_hero_heading": "Flavours That Follow the Season",
        "about_hero_subtitle": "Some flavours are made to stay. Others arrive only when the season feels right.\n\nAt Mamma, our collection brings together enduring classics and seasonal creations inspired by ingredients at their most expressive. Each seasonal flavour is produced in small batches and available for a limited time, giving us the freedom to explore something new while preserving the quality of every batch.\n\nA new fruit at its brightest, a familiar ingredient seen differently, or a flavour that simply belongs to a particular moment of the year—each season brings another reason to return.",
